stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> IssueSelected
    IssueSelected --> ImplementPlan: Maya invokes /3c-implement
    ImplementPlan --> BranchCreated: /3c-implement creates branch
    BranchCreated --> FailingTest: test-author drafts the failing test, /3c-test writes and runs it
    FailingTest --> ClaudeImpl: Claude Code implements

    ClaudeImpl --> PostEdit

    state PostEdit <<choice>>
    PostEdit --> ClaudeImpl: fail — Claude Code revises
    PostEdit --> StageCommit: pass in ~300ms

    StageCommit --> PreCommit: Maya runs git commit
    state PreCommit <<choice>>
    PreCommit --> ClaudeImpl: fail — lint / types / unit / secret\nClaude Code regenerates
    PreCommit --> GateChain: pass under 10s

    GateChain --> SecurityReviewer: optional dispatch\nfor auth-touching change
    SecurityReviewer --> PRDescription: findings applied by Claude Code
    GateChain --> PRDescription: pass under 60s

    PRDescription --> CodeReviewer: code-reviewer subagent runs
    CodeReviewer --> ApplyFindings: Maya prompts which findings to apply
    ApplyFindings --> Merge: Claude Code applies them
    Merge --> [*]: merge to main

    note right of ClaudeImpl
        every code-changing
        transition labelled
        with who typed it —
        Claude Code, /3c-implement,
        /3c-test. Never Maya.
    end note
